Z||000019||RFMike||12-01-1999||08:32 PM||||I used to drive anywhere from 500 to 1200 a miles a week, but I have a new job, without the out of town road trips.  I bought my 86GT  as a daily driver, and I've never regretted it, with the exception of the coil going belly up in the middle of nowhere.<BR>Gonna miss those drives to small town high schools, where the young wrench's first comments were usually, "What is it, a Ferrari?"  ||||reg||1
